SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;For detailed information on the UWB test setup please read the document, UWB_Radar_Setup.doc.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;,&apos;serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;Detailed information about the UWB test system setup can be found in the UWB_Radar_Setup.doc in the DIR, Examples\Instruments\Radar\.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;This example can be used as a template for generating custom waveforms.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Users can open&amp;nbsp;these models and modify it as needed to create custom models for&amp;nbsp;their own&amp;nbsp;waveforms in the system simulation and testing.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;</Text>
